<h2 id="what-is-gohighlevel">🔍 What Is GoHighLevel?</h2>

GoHighLevel (often abbreviated as GHL) is an all-in-one sales and marketing platform originally built for agencies but increasingly adopted by multi-location business operators. It consolidates CRM, email marketing, SMS campaigns, reputation management, appointment scheduling, funnel building, and phone systems into a single dashboard.

For multi-location operators, the critical selling point is the sub-account architecture. Instead of paying per-user or per-location fees that balloon your costs, GoHighLevel's SaaS Pro plan ($497/month) lets you create unlimited sub-accounts—one for each location—with centralized reporting and management.

The platform competes directly with combinations like HubSpot + Podium + Calendly + Twilio, but at a fraction of the total cost. Our team has evaluated dozens of CRM solutions for multi-location businesses, and GoHighLevel consistently ranks among the top three for operators managing between 5 and 100 locations.

